# Chrysalis public URL

When referring to the live Chrysalis Translation product UI, use:

**https://chrysalis.agenticop.io/**

- Domain `hub.agenticop.io` is an alias to the same app — do not treat it as the primary Chrysalis URL in user-facing copy, verify checks, or demos unless the user asks for that host specifically.
- Do not change DNS or nginx hostnames without an explicit amend to DESIGN D6396 / `docs/HUB-DEMO-INSTALL.md`.
